  "rulings": [
    {
      "oracle_id": "26005003-afcb-4c32-a760-be950246ff0f",
      "published_at": "2024-06-07",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "Since Planar Nexus has the subtypes Urza's, Mine, Power-Plant, and Tower, it will satisfy all of the requirements for the abilities of Urza's Mine, Urza's Power Plant, and Urza's Tower to add additional mana. For example, if you control Planar Nexus and Urza's Tower, the ability of Urza's Tower will add {C}{C}{C}."
    },
    {
      "oracle_id": "26005003-afcb-4c32-a760-be950246ff0f",
      "published_at": "2024-06-07",
      "source": "wotc",
      "comment": "The list of nonbasic land types in the reminder text is exhaustive as of the release of Modern Horizons 3. The full list of land types can always be found in the Comprehensive Rules of Magic."
    },
    {
      "comment": "The ability checks for land types, not the names of other permanents you control.",
      "oracle_id": "32fbb638-ab14-4e8b-a07a-d4c44e3496f2",
      "published_at": "2024-06-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a nonbasic land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it can apply. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply \"as\" a land enters the battlefield, such as the first ability of Cavern of Souls.",
      "oracle_id": "94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "If a nonbasic land has an ability that triggers \"when\" it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it can trigger.",
      "oracle_id": "94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "Nonbasic lands will lose any other land types and abilities they had. They will gain the land type Mountain and gain the ability \"{T}: Add {R}.\"",
      "oracle_id": "94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    },
    {
      "comment": "This effect doesn't affect names or supertypes. It won't turn any land into a basic land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land, and the lands won't be named \"Mountain.\"",
      "oracle_id": "94fac5fe-97d5-4c12-a80c-8efff9d853ae",
      "published_at": "2020-08-07",
      "source": "wotc"
    }
  ],
